__________________________________________FREQUENCY ____________________________________________________________
SO LET US CONSIDER AN ARRAY OF ELEMENTS=[20,20,30,30,40]
HERE WE NEED TO FIND THE FREUENCY OF THE ELEMENTS IN AN ARRAY
NOTE:
ELEMENTS ARE IN SORTED MANNER
IT IS THE NUMBER OF TIMES IT OCCURS IN A ARRAY
class Solution:
    def check_freq(self,arr):
        freq=1
        i=1
        while(i<len(arr)):
            while(i<len(arr) and arr[i]==arr[i-1]):
                freq+=1
                i+=1
            print(arr[i-1] , freq)
            freq=1
            i+=1
            if i-1 < len(arr) and i==len(arr):
                  print(arr[i-1] ,freq)
s=Solution()
